    "message": "Make the README a companion to the guides, and correct it (v1.5.7)\n\nThe README described output that TaxSEA() has not returned for some time\n(three data frames, 5 columns, median_rank), listed BugSigDB as one of six\ndefault databases although it has been opt-in since 1.5.4, never mentioned\nssTaxSEA(), and named taxon_set_ranks() and data(TaxSEA_DB), neither of\nwhich exists. Fixed all of these, listed the literature-collated set\nsources, and added a table linking the website guides. The main vignette\ncarried the same output error.\n\nThe website now leads with Guides, in reading order, including the\nsingle-sample page that was missing from the menu.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
    "time": 1789949482
  },
